      "id": "claim_869dd2b4bdc54bc4b947c97b054fd52c",
      "statement": "The Fedwire Funds Connector uses FedLine Direct with dual MQ channels (primary Columbus, contingency Charlotte) and has used ISO 20022 exclusively since the Federal Reserve's single-day cutover on 2025-07-14, retiring the legacy FAIM format; outbound types include pacs.008/009/004 and camt.056/110, inbound types include pacs.008/009/004, pacs.002, and admi.002.",
