    {
      "id": "claim_1cb8d7316c37429eac16b21e71fee95c",
      "statement": "FFC publishes Federal Reserve pacs.002 acknowledgments (with OMAD) to topic net.fedwire.ack.v1 as event EV-PNG-01 and admi.002 errors with the IMAD reference; acceptance by the Fedwire Funds Service is final settlement under Regulation J, but the Fed does not report credit to the beneficiary's account at the receiving bank. Q3-2025 metrics: median Fed ack latency 4.2s, median PPH RELEASED-to-acceptance 6 min, reject rate 0.07%.",
      "evidence": [
